## Your Organization’s Knowledge: Secure It, Multiply It, Profit From It—Without the Usual Headaches or Hefty Bills.

&nbsp;

Orion is the Jamstack Wiki Platform that delivers [unhackable security](security#separation-of-concerns-and-engineering-tradeoffs10) :fa-lock:, [lightning performance](features) :fa-cloud-bolt:, [unbreakable reliability](https://iconoclasts.blog/joe/apache-cms#:~:text=7%20years) :fa-train:, and true ROI :fa-chart-line:—while costing far less than Confluence or Notion.

&nbsp;

It’s the enterprise platform {# lede #}for creating, managing, and delivering knowledge that actually works{# lede #} — <span class="text-white">for leaders who refuse to settle for fragile tools that drain time and money.</span>

&nbsp;

Why Orion? Because in a world of data breaches and bloated SaaS bills, your knowledge should be your greatest asset—not a liability. Orion turns scattered documentation into a secure, searchable, self-updating competitive edge. And it does so at a fraction of the cost of legacy solutions.

&nbsp;

