# <span class="text-warning-emphasis">For Young&nbsp;Academics&nbsp;:fa-orcid: / Full&nbsp;Stack&nbsp;Developers&nbsp;:fa-stack-overflow: / Public&nbsp;Bloggers&nbsp;:fa-blog:&nbsp;</span>

&nbsp;

# Want a Lightning-Fast :fa-cloud-bolt:, Secure Personal Site :fa-lock: That's Dead-Simple to Manage &mdash; Yet Incredibly Powerful?
</div>

&nbsp;

Need more horsepower than a [one-trick pony like Hugo](https://www.iconoclasts.blog/joe/ssg) can muster :fa-horse:?

&nbsp;

If you are tired of the per-seat licensing and per-CPU-cycle choices weighing you down with other Jamstack hosting vendors, whenever you just need to fix a typo, [reach out to us](/contact).

&nbsp;

If you are in charge of content curation and are pining for a customizable facts database to manage your external links, or if you are a regex-equipped lion tamer for decades of accumulated legacy HTML content, or just someone dissatisfied with the other options on the market and how they function at scale, we have something really special to offer you.

&nbsp;

Never having to deal directly with a version control system, or even a static site generator, on your own personal computer is up to you. The online CMS Editor/IDE is designed and ready for your **browser-only workflow** whenever you are.  In a pinch, even the mobile (browser) interface :fa-mobile: will get it done, *instantly* :fa-cloud-bolt:.

&nbsp;

