&nbsp;

When Apache software project communities were presented with a free choice between using Confluence-backed sites, or using Orion's roots as [the Apache CMS](https://www.iconoclasts.blog/joe/apache-cms), they overwhelmingly chose the Apache CMS. We think you will too, with its vastly improved Orion!

&nbsp;

